    47	/**
    48	 * See `db.ts`: delete the registration, then terminalize every UNCLAIMED ledger row whose wakeup is
    49	 * webhook-**primary**, completing that wakeup too — in the same synchronous section, this store's
    50	 * stand-in for "the same statement".
